{"id":"CVE-2018-21029","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2019-10-30T21:46:51.000Z","updated":"2024-08-05T12:19:27.514Z","description":"systemd 239 through 245 accepts any certificate signed by a trusted certificate authority for DNS Over TLS. Server Name Indication (SNI) is not sent, and there is no hostname validation with the GnuTLS backend. NOTE: This has been disputed by the developer as not a vulnerability since hostname validation does not have anything to do with this issue (i.e. there is no hostname to be sent)","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/systemd/systemd/issues/9397","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://blog.cloudflare.com/dns-encryption-explained/","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/v243/src/resolve/resolved-dnstls-gnutls.c#L62-L63","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/4NLJVOJMB6ANDILRLDZK26YGLYBEPHKY/","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_FEDORA"],"name":"FEDORA-2019-4c3ce3aa5c"},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20191122-0002/","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"https://github.com/systemd/systemd/pull/13870","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/v243/man/resolved.conf.xml#L196-L207","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/systemd/systemd/blob/v239/man/resolved.conf.xml#L199-L207","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7858#section-4.1","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["crypto-libs"]}
